{"path":"io/c/fgetws","title":"std::fgetws","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>fgetws","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/c/fgetws","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Reads at most count - 1 wide characters from the given file stream and stores them in str. The produced wide string is always null-terminated.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cwchar\">&lt;cwchar&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> fgetws<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> str, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> count, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/FILE\"><span class=\"kw1893\">std::<span class=\"me2\">FILE</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Reads at most <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> wide characters from the given file stream and stores them in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code>. The produced wide string is always null-terminated. Parsing stops if end-of-file occurs or a newline wide character is found, in which case <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> will contain that wide newline character.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> str\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> wide string to read the characters to\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> count\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the length of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> stream\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> file stream to read the data from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> on success, a null pointer on an error.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;array&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;clocale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdio&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwchar&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwctype&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;span&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> dump<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2647\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> sp, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> width <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">14</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> wc <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> sp<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1776\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/iswprint\"><span class=\"kw1198\">std::<span class=\"me2\">iswp